'''Wicked Face''' (魔我王, ''Ma Gaō'') is an [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] variant of [[The Face]] that appears in [[The Aku Realms]] and [[Legend Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 10.9 Update|Version 10.9]].

