==Trivia==
*Just like [[Sathankhamun VIII]], his design is most likely a reference to Big Ben and Little Ben, the demon-costumed bacteria seen in some of TOTO's [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wag1pjUya94 toilet commercials], as his Japanese description raises the possibility that he, too, is a form of bacterium.
*His Japanese name, Ma Gaō (魔我王), is a pun on the word ''magao'' (真顔), meaning "serious face" or "straight face". The individual kanji used in the enemy's name mean "demon" or "evil spirit" (魔), "ego" or "self-assertion" (我) and "king" (王).
*His English description is missing the apostrophe in "it's".
*He, [[Sinner Snache]], [[Condemned Peng]], [[Le'Behemoth]] and [[Fallen Bear]] were added to the game files in [[Version 10.8 Update|Version 10.8]], but were unimplemented and used [[Doge]]'s stats and sprites as placeholders until [[Version 10.9 Update|Version 10.9]].

